     },
     "html": "<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Hey {{ contact.firstname }},</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">One of the most common topics your patients might bring up is \"immune health.\" This could mean many things, though, and most people will only look into it once they are experiencing flu or cold-like symptoms.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">How can you encourage your patients to take an active, even proactive, approach to their everyday wellness and immune support?&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Information and education are key to empowering your patients. Whether they are experiencing symptoms or not, utilizing our resources can help them take ownership of their wellness.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">This month, we have an article and recommended supplements to help your patients find new ways to support their immune system.</span></p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
