      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<h2 style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 175%;\"><span style=\"color: #76bc43;\">Spread the Word About Vitamin C on Your Social Feed</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Whether it's the cold months of winter, or a beautiful summer day, our body is constantly protecting us from illness. One of the most common ways to strengthen the defense of our immune systems is with vitamin C, but how can you ensure your body is getting enough? Liposomal forms of vitamin C are a powerful way to support your body through increased absorption. This article covers the benefits of taking a liposomal form of vitamin C, read it to learn more!</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Read <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/\" style=\"color: #000000;\" rel=\"noopener\">our article</a> and share it throughout your social pages so you can spread the knowledge with the people who rely on your care.</span></p>\n<ul></ul>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
    "child_css": {},
    "css": {},
    "id": "module_16783031312213",
    "label": null,
    "module_id": 1155639,
